// CLAIM: eprint / eprintln write to standard error, variadic without a separator like print /
//        println, and nothing of it reaches standard output.
// GUIDE: SkarnGuide.md §22 "Printing"; SkarnStdlib.md §1
// EXPECT: warn to stderr: 42 true 2.5
eprint("to stderr: ", 42)
eprintln(" ", true, " ", 2.5)
eprintln()
